<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Victoria state to sell gas assets in 1998.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Victoria state to sell gas assets in 1998.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Victoria state government on Monday said it planned to split its gas monopoly into competing retailers and distributors this year, before putting them up for sale early in calendar 1998.</p>
</text>
